{"t":"OXY","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Occidental Petroleum Corporation","ko":"옥시덴탈","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas E&P","employees":10412,"hq":"Houston, TX, United States","website":"https://www.oxy.com","summary_en":"Occidental Petroleum Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the acquisition, exploration, and development of oil and gas properties in the United States and internationally. It operates through Oil and Gas and Midstream and Marketing. The Oil and Gas segment explores for, develops, and produces oil and condensate, natural gas liquids (NGLs), and natural gas. This segment also optimizes its transportation and storage capacity and invests in entities. The Midstream and Marketing segment purchases, markets, gathers, processes, transports and stores oil, condensate, NGLs, natural gas, carbon dioxide, and power. Occidental Petroleum Corporation was founded in 1920 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Occidental Petroleum Corporation은 자회사와 함께 미국 및 국제적으로 석유 및 가스 자산의 인수, 탐사 및 개발에 참여하고 있습니다. 석유 및 가스, 미드스트림 및 마케팅을 통해 운영됩니다. 석유 및 가스 부문은 석유 및 응축수, 천연가스 액체(NGL) 및 천연가스를 탐색, 개발 및 생산합니다. 이 부문은 또한 운송 및 보관 용량을 최적화하고 기업에 투자합니다. 미드스트림 및 마케팅 부문은 석유, 응축수, NGL, 천연 가스, 이산화탄소 및 전력을 구매, 시장, 수집, 처리, 운송 및 저장합니다. Occidental Petroleum Corporation은 1920년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 휴스턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":56.36,"mcap":56339562496.0,"pe":16.011364,"fpe":11.237724,"peg":0.8599,"ps":2.3547423,"pb":1.6839463,"ev_ebitda":5.521,"div":1.99,"beta":0.149,"hi52":67.45,"lo52":38.8},"fin":{"rev":23925999616.0,"rev_g":0.534,"eps_g":9.649,"gross":0.73318,"op":0.45443,"net":0.30318,"roe":0.10629,"fcf":3788124928.0,"cash":4150000128.0,"debt":14625999872.0,"de":34.511,"eps":3.52,"feps":5.01525},"own":{"short":0.0002,"inst":0.58443,"insider":0.26811},"analyst":{"n":27,"mean":70.74074,"median":70.0,"high":82.0,"low":60.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.21429,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":10,"hold":16,"sell":0,"strongSe